  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-video\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Garfield, New Jersey · Wedding photography &amp; film</p><h1>Stephanie &amp; Danny<br><em>The Venetian</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">Stephanie and Danny at The Venetian, in film and four selected photographs.</p><nav class=\"gv-story-nav\" aria-label=\"Explore this wedding\"><a href=\"#wedding-film\">The film</a><a href=\"#wedding-photographs\">The photographs</a></nav></header><section id=\"wedding-film\" class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Stephanie &amp; Danny wedding film\"><div class=\"gv-film-heading\"><h2>The wedding film</h2></div><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1024/683\"><img src=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-venetian-staircase.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" alt=\"Stephanie and Danny on The Venetian grand staircase\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"331322129\" data-film-title=\"Stephanie &amp; Danny at The Venetian\" aria-label=\"Play wedding film, Stephanie &amp; Danny at The Venetian\"><span>Play wedding film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Stephanie &amp; Danny · A film by GioLina Films</p></section><section id=\"wedding-photographs\" class=\"gv-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-story-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Selected photographs</p><h2 id=\"gv-story-title\">From the staircase to the first dance.</h2><p>Portraits on the grand staircase and outside at dusk, followed by their entrance and first dance.</p></section><section class=\"gv-gallery\" aria-label=\"Selected photographs of Stephanie &amp; Danny\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-venetian-staircase.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Stephanie and Danny sharing a kiss on The Venetian staircase beneath a chandelier\"><img src=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-venetian-staircase-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-venetian-staircase-small.webp 640w, /assets/stephanie-danny-venetian-staircase.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Stephanie and Danny sharing a kiss on The Venetian staircase beneath a chandelier\"></a><figcaption>Beneath the chandelier on The Venetian’s grand staircase.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-evening-portrait.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Stephanie and Danny together on an evening terrace\"><img src=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-evening-portrait-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-evening-portrait-small.webp 640w, /assets/stephanie-danny-evening-portrait.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Stephanie and Danny together on an evening terrace\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-entrance.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Stephanie and Danny celebrating their entrance beneath ballroom chandeliers\"><img src=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-entrance-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-entrance-small.webp 640w, /assets/stephanie-danny-entrance.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Stephanie and Danny celebrating their entrance beneath ballroom chandeliers\"></a><figcaption>Stephanie and Danny make their entrance into the ballroom.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-first-dance.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Stephanie and Danny sharing their first dance\"><img src=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-first-dance-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-first-dance-small.webp 640w, /assets/stephanie-danny-first-dance.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Stephanie and Danny sharing their first dance\"></a><figcaption>Their first dance at The Venetian in Garfield.</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"gv-context\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-context-title\"><div><p class=\"gv-kicker\">The setting · Bergen County</p><h2 id=\"gv-context-title\">The Venetian</h2></div><div><p>The Venetian is on River Drive in Garfield. Its grand staircase and chandelier lit ballroom appear in Stephanie and Danny’s photographs.</p><a class=\"gv-text-link\" href=\"https://www.venetiannj.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit the venue website</a></div></section><div class=\"gv-collection-link\"><a href=\"/photography/wedding-collection/\">View the wedding photography collection</a></div><section class=\"gv-inquire\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-inquire-title\"><h2 id=\"gv-inquire-title\">Your wedding at The Venetian</h2><p>Share your date, venue and the coverage you have in mind.</p><a class=\"gv-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Inquire about your wedding</a><div class=\"gv-links\"><a href=\"/cinematography/\">Explore wedding films</a><a href=\"/photography/\">Explore wedding photography</a></div></section><section class=\"gv-next\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-next-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Explore more wedding stories</p><h2 id=\"gv-next-title\"><a href=\"/weddings/the-park-savoy-florham-park/\">Deanna &amp; Anthony at The Park Savoy</a></h2></section></article><script src=\"/photography-viewer.js\" defer></script>"
